{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-composer-resize#card-zh","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-composer-resize","commit":"59429767b7bde21f1e69688eb5863f7aa6965b7d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-resize 是一个面向 DSH 网页客户端的聊天输入框尺寸插件。它通过客户端 DOM 增强，在输入卡片顶部加入拖动把手，调整输入框高度而不接管宿主的 React 组件。用户可以拖动设置固定高度，让超出内容在框内滚动，也可以双击把手恢复自动增高；插件还会显示拖动时的像素高度，在浏览器 localStorage 保存模式和高度，并在页面重建输入区域后重新应用。它适合希望按自己的编辑习惯调整聊天输入区域的 DSH 网页用户。使用时不需要 API Key 或外部服务，设置会保存在本地浏览器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:17-32","lib/client.js:107-130","lib/client.js:169-213","lib/client.js:246-258"]}
{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-composer-resize#card-en","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-composer-resize","commit":"59429767b7bde21f1e69688eb5863f7aa6965b7d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-composer-resize adds a drag handle to the DSH web chat composer. Drag to set a fixed height with internal scrolling; double-click to restore automatic growth. It saves height and mode in browser localStorage and reapplies them after rebuilding. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:17-32","lib/client.js:107-130","lib/client.js:169-213","lib/client.js:246-258"]}
