{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-composer-resize#feature-1","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-composer-resize","commit":"59429767b7bde21f1e69688eb5863f7aa6965b7d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-resize 的功能「拖动调整高度」：在聊天输入卡片顶部拖动把手即可调整输入框高度，拖动时显示像素值，拖动结束后保持设定高度，超出内容在框内滚动。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:169-199"]}
{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-composer-resize#feature-2","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-composer-resize","commit":"59429767b7bde21f1e69688eb5863f7aa6965b7d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-resize 的功能「恢复自动增高」：双击顶部把手即可清除固定高度并回到自动增高模式，默认上限为 168px。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:119-125","lib/client.js:205-213"]}
{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-composer-resize#feature-3","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-composer-resize","commit":"59429767b7bde21f1e69688eb5863f7aa6965b7d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-resize 的功能「记住输入框状态」：拖动结束时把高度和固定或自动模式写入浏览器 localStorage，后续初始化时读取并恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:64-89","lib/client.js:156-164"]}
{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-composer-resize#feature-4","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-composer-resize","commit":"59429767b7bde21f1e69688eb5863f7aa6965b7d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-resize 的功能「适配重建后的输入框」：页面 DOM 变化时通过 MutationObserver 安排重新增强，并用定时检查作为补充，给重建的输入卡片重新加把手和高度设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:216-244","lib/client.js:246-258"]}
{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-composer-resize#caveat-1","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-composer-resize","commit":"59429767b7bde21f1e69688eb5863f7aa6965b7d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-resize 使用前须知：功能依赖页面提供 data-composer-card 和 data-input-scroll 标记；若宿主更改这些标记，输入框增强可能不再生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:23-27","lib/client.js:216-223"]}
